BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>The sky through a black hole (Vulkan client)</h1>
A delta-glider on a circular orbit 30 masses from the test black hole
(10^5 solar masses, spin 0.9), the hole ahead: the client's ray tracer
(lens_trace.comp, single precision) against the core's Kerr geodesics
(Kerr.h, double precision): which rays the hole captures, where the others
come from (ORBITER_VK_LENS_CHECK).
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System BlackHoleTest
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/LensView
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship BH
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET BH
  MODE Extern
  POS 3.0 0 10
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 60.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
BH:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting TestHole
  ELEMENTS 1.0e12 0.00000 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
